# Slack OAuth token (required)
# Create a Slack App at https://api.slack.com/apps
# A bot token (xoxb-) acts as the app's bot user; a user token (xoxp-) acts as
# the person who authorized it. Scopes per tool are listed in README.md:
# channels:read, channels:history, groups:read, groups:history, chat:write,
# users:read, users:read.email, im:write, im:history
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-your-token-here
